---
---

<section class="py-24 relative" id="para-quien">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-20 relative z-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow/10 border border-hero-glow/20 text-hero-glow text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">
        Tu Perfil
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        ¿Para quién es Valora?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed">
        Diseñado para profesionales de cualquier industria que buscan tomar el control de su trayectoria y maximizar sus ingresos.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="relative group p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 hover:border-hero-glow/30 transition-colors duration-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-hero-glow/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-48 h-48 bg-hero-glow/10 rounded-full blur-3xl translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700"></div>
        
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-linear-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-hero-glow shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-hero-glow/50 transition-all duration-500">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Empleados y Asalariados</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed group-hover:text-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300">
            Descubre si estás cobrando por debajo del mercado. Obtén los datos y argumentos que necesitas para negociar tu próximo aumento de sueldo o ascenso.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="relative group p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 hover:border-hero-glow/30 transition-colors duration-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-hero-glow/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-48 h-48 bg-hero-glow/10 rounded-full blur-3xl translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700"></div>
        
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-linear-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-hero-glow shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-hero-glow/50 transition-all duration-500">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="7" rx="2" ry="2"/>
              <path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Freelancers y Consultores</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed group-hover:text-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300">
            Termina con la incertidumbre al cotizar un servicio. Usa nuestra IA para presupuestar tus proyectos y justificar tus tarifas con confianza ante cualquier cliente.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="relative group p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 hover:border-hero-glow/30 transition-colors duration-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-hero-glow/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-48 h-48 bg-hero-glow/10 rounded-full blur-3xl translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700"></div>
        
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-linear-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-hero-glow shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-hero-glow/50 transition-all duration-500">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polygon points="3 6 9 3 15 6 21 3 21 18 15 21 9 18 3 21"/>
              <line x1="9" x2="9" y1="3" y2="18"/>
              <line x1="15" x2="15" y1="6" y2="21"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Juniors y Estudiantes</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed group-hover:text-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300">
            Descubre exactamente qué habilidades demanda el mercado actual. Obtén una ruta de crecimiento clara para conseguir tu primer empleo más rápido.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
